{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\"\n       xmlns:c=\"urn:example:custom\"\n       initial=\"missing\">\n  <state id=\"ready\">\n    <transition event=\"finish, abort\" target=\"don\"/>\n    <c:mark value=\"not-an-integer\"/>\n    <log expr=\"'misplaced'\"/>\n  </state>\n  <state id=\"ready\"/>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/multi-diagnostic-ordering.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":6,"notes":0,"total":7,"warnings":1},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/multi-diagnostic-ordering.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":107,"endColumn":25,"endLine":3,"startColumn":25,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":" version=\"1.0\""}}]}],"description":{"text":"add `version=\"1.0\"`"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/multi-diagnostic-ordering.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":7,"endLine":1,"startColumn":2,"startLine":1}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<scxml>` is missing required attribute `version`\n\n**Note:** the W3C SCXML 1.0 schema rejects this under XML Schema constraint `cvc-complex-type.4`: Required attribute 'version' is missing\n\n**Help:** `version` must be `1.0`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.2 <scxml>\n\n**Spec:** XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.4.4 Element Locally Valid (Complex Type) (`cvc-complex-type.4`)","text":"`<scxml>` is missing required attribute `version`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":6,"start":1},"category":"schema"},"ruleId":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.4"},{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/multi-diagnostic-ordering.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":24,"endLine":3,"startColumn":17,"startLine":3}